<Page title="How we make money" description="grassfed.food earns commissions from some links in its guides. Farms can't pay for listings or placement. Here is how it works.">
  <p class="lede">grassfed.food is free to use and free for farms. We pay for it through commissions on some links in our guides.</p>
  <h2>Paid links</h2>
  <p>When a guide links to a company whose affiliate program we've joined, that link is marked "paid link" and the article opens with a notice. If you buy through it, the company may pay us a commission. The price you pay is the same.</p>
  <h2>What money can't buy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Farms can't pay to be listed, verified or ranked. The directory contains no paid placements.</li>
    <li>Companies can't pay to be included in a guide, to be ranked higher, or to review what we write before it's published.</li>
    <li>A company having an affiliate program never changes what we say about it. Several companies we write about pay us nothing.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>If you think a page doesn't meet these rules, <a href="/corrections/">tell us</a>.</p>
</Page>
